From 9e0184c269b6f6de383383be1be74efe47b68206 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: KakaruHayate <kakaru@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 20:49:32 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] ggml: port ggml-audio-patch learned-ops + qvac-ops + vulkan
 conv-direct-1d + pipeline cache onto llama.cpp

- learned-ops: IM2COL_FAST_1D, conv_transpose_1d_ext (groups/output_padding/padding),
  REL_POS_BIAS, SCATTER_ELEMENTS, ADD_LEAKY_RELU, CONV_DIRECT_1D(_fused)
- qvac-ops: SUPERTONIC_* fused kernels (CPU), GRU, ZERO_UPSAMPLE, CHANNEL_SHUFFLE,
  AFFINE_PRELU, SNAKE (Vulkan shaders + dispatch)
- vulkan: grouped conv_transpose_1d shader, conv_direct_1d.comp (5 tile variants),
  VK_EXT_shader_atomic_float probing, disk-backed persistent pipeline cache
- CPU/CUDA/Metal dispatch + supports_op updated; ggml op count 92 -> 116
- tests-learned smoke tests: ALL PASSED (cpu build)
